via a driver-local reloc apply (asm 0x2c9b: `mov bx,[0x70e]; mov si,0x1c8; lcall [DGROUP:0x12]` = the FAR
applier FUN_0000_f842).  Section si=0x1c8 of the DGROUP:0x70e template buffer installs DGROUP:0x1594..
